{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/03/8022788/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Hello"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/03/8022788/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメント読みながら思ったこと"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/03/8022788/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"イヤイヤイヤイヤ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/03/8022788/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハーフツインが似合うの？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/03/8022788/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"恥ずかしくて写メのせるのどうしようか迷ったくらいなので、似合うって言ってくれて嬉しかったけど、きっともうしないよ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/03/8022788/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たぶんね〜笑"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/03/8022788/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/03/8022788/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆様ありがとです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/03/8022788/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/03/8022788/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回の答えはね〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/03/8022788/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"難しくてなんて書いていいかわからなくなっちゃった〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/03/8022788/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも知ってるかたが沢山のいてビックリ!!\n凄いな〜中にはお医者さんや、たまごさんも居たりして..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/03/8022788/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろんなお仕事されてる方々に読んでもらえてて嬉しいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/03/8022788/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"又解らない事は教えて下さい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/03/8022788/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今ね、お買い物に行ってレジに行ったら店員さんが\n『制服ですか？』\nって言われて、学校帰りだから\n『はい』\nっていったの！\nどこの学校？と聞いてくれてなんか仲良くなった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/03/8022788/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/03/8022788/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/03/8022788/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/03/8022788/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/03/8022788/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"店員さんから見てるとまぁやは高校生に見えたらしい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/03/8022788/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/03/8022788/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/03/8022788/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前みなみと焼き肉行こー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/03/8022788/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってなって二人で行こうと思ったんだけど、\nやっぱ大人数でワイワイもいいね\nと思って、\n斎藤ゆうり"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/03/8022788/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"齊藤あすか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/03/8022788/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"川後ひな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/03/8022788/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"星野みなみ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/03/8022788/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"川村まひろ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/03/8022788/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"畠中せいら"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/03/8022788/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でいきました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/03/8022788/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いっぱいたべておいしかったすー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/03/8022788/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しかった♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやは何日間かけてブログを書くので\n今日の事ではない事もあるよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/03/8022788/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆もいつもコメントくれてありがとう♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、今週末はお母さんが来てたので母さんと渋谷に行ったりデートをしました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/03/8022788/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"母さんとは久しぶりだったので、会った時は、\n「背が伸びたね〜！」\nって嬉しそうだったよ...笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はひな祭り！cakeを食べるよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/03/8022788/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さて、今日のわたしの昼御飯はなんでしょ？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/03/8022788/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/03/8022788/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/03/8022788/0013.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}